{"id":57903,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:22:48","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:22:48","slug":"maratona-de-san-sebastian","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-san-sebastian\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026<\/strong> (47\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Zurich Marat\u00f3n Donostia-San Sebasti\u00e1n<\/strong>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na cidade costeira de <strong>San Sebasti\u00e1n (Donostia)<\/strong>, na prov\u00edncia de Gipuzkoa, Pa\u00eds Basco, <strong>Espanha<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Segunda maratona mais antiga de Espanha, destaca-se pelo seu circuito 100% urbano, plano e ao n\u00edvel do mar, desenhado para bater recordes pessoais. Com partida na <strong>Calle Hernani<\/strong> (junto aos jardins de Alderdi Eder e ao Ayuntamiento) e meta no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Boulevard<\/strong> ap\u00f3s uma reta final plana de mais de 1 km, o tra\u00e7ado percorre os bairros do Centro, Antiguo, Amara e Gros, passando pelo ic\u00f3nico <strong>Paseo de la Concha<\/strong>, Teatro Victoria Eugenia, Catedral del Buen Pastor, Est\u00e1dio de Anoeta e Pal\u00e1cio de Congressos Kursaal. O evento integra duas dist\u00e2ncias homologadas: <strong>Maratona (42,195 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Corrida 10K (10 km)<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Impulsionada pela <strong>Federaci\u00f3n Atl\u00e9tica Guipuzcoana (F.A.G.)<\/strong> e pela <strong>UTE Donosti Eventos-RPM-Racing<\/strong> sob homologa\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>World Athletics (WA)<\/strong> e da <strong>Real Federaci\u00f3n Espa\u00f1ola de Atletismo (RFEA)<\/strong>, a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026 re\u00fane 11.500 corredores (com os 7.000 dorsais da Maratona esgotados e 4.500 vagas nos 10K), disponibilizando 35 pacemakers em 8 ritmos de prova entre as 2h45 e as 5h00. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-colum