 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00ba Escal\u00e3o (Dorsais 5501 a 7000):<\/strong> 95,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (At\u00e9 7.000 dorsais (Esgotado))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida 10 km<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10K Donostia<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00ba Escal\u00e3o (Primeiros 500 dorsais):<\/strong> 22,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Dorsais 1 a 500)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00ba Escal\u00e3o (Dorsais 501 a 2000):<\/strong> 28,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Dorsais 501 a 2.000)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00ba Escal\u00e3o (Dorsais 2001 a 4500):<\/strong> 32,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Dorsais 2.001 a 4.500)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 47\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Zurich Marat\u00f3n Donostia-San Sebasti\u00e1n realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida na Calle Hernani (junto aos jardins de Alderdi Eder) e meta na Alameda del Boulevard, no centro de San Sebasti\u00e1n, Espanha.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e tempos limite das provas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, a Corrida 10K parte \u00e0s 08:15 (tempo limite de 1h10, com corte aos 5 km em 35 min) e a Maratona de 42,195 km parte \u00e0s 09:00 por vagas de ritmo (tempo limite de 5h00, com cortes interm\u00e9dios de 35 min a cada 5 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o limite de participantes?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Maratona (limitada a 7.000 dorsais, j\u00e1 esgotados) teve 5 escal\u00f5es de pre\u00e7o por lote de dorsais: 59 \u20ac (1-1000), 69 \u20ac (1001-2500), 79 \u20ac (2501-4000), 89 \u20ac (4001-5500) e 95 \u20ac (5501-7000), acrescidos de 5 \u20ac de licen\u00e7a di\u00e1ria RFEA para n\u00e3o federados. A prova de 10K (limitada a 4.500 dorsais) custa 22 \u20ac (primeiros 500), 28 \u20ac (501-2000) e 32 \u20ac (2001-4500).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona a Expo Sports para levantamento do dorsal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal-chip e da t-shirt oficial Kiprun decorre exclusivamente no Centro Kursaal Elkargunea (Av. de la Zurriola 1) na sexta-feira, 20 de novembro (das 16:00 \u00e0s 20:00), e no s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro (das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00). N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo da prova.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem pacemakers (marcadores de ritmo) e guarda-roupa na prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. A Maratona disp\u00f5e de 35 pacemakers distribu\u00eddos por 8 objetivos de tempo final: 2h45, 3h00, 3h15, 3h30, 3h45, 4h00, 4h30 e 5h00. O servi\u00e7o de guarda-roupa funciona no Pal\u00e1cio de Congressos Kursaal durante a Expo Sports e no domingo da prova entre as 07:00 e as 08:15 (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 07:45 para os atletas dos 10K).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"San Sebasti\u00e1n, Espanha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Espanha\", \"addressRegion\": \"Espanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"description\": \"A Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026 (47\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se a 22 de novembro no Pa\u00eds Basco, Espanha. Percurso plano de 42,195 km e 10 km. Consulta hor\u00e1rios e info!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-maratona-de-san-sebastian.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Zurich Marat\u00f3n San Sebasti\u00e1n (42,195 Km)\", \"price\": \"59.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/zurichmaratonsansebastian.com\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 10K Donostia\", \"price\": \"22.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/zurichmaratonsansebastian.com\/\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 47\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Zurich Marat\u00f3n Donostia-San Sebasti\u00e1n realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida na Calle Hernani (junto aos jardins de Alderdi Eder) e meta na Alameda del Boulevard, no centro de San Sebasti\u00e1n, Espanha.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e tempos limite das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, a Corrida 10K parte \u00e0s 08:15 (tempo limite de 1h10, com corte aos 5 km em 35 min) e a Maratona de 42,195 km parte \u00e0s 09:00 por vagas de ritmo (tempo limite de 5h00, com cortes interm\u00e9dios de 35 min a cada 5 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o limite de participantes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Maratona (limitada a 7.000 dorsais, j\u00e1 esgotados) teve 5 escal\u00f5es de pre\u00e7o por lote de dorsais: 59 \u20ac (1-1000), 69 \u20ac (1001-2500), 79 \u20ac (2501-4000), 89 \u20ac (4001-5500) e 95 \u20ac (5501-7000), acrescidos de 5 \u20ac de licen\u00e7a di\u00e1ria RFEA para n\u00e3o federados. A prova de 10K (limitada a 4.500 dorsais) custa 22 \u20ac (primeiros 500), 28 \u20ac (501-2000) e 32 \u20ac (2001-4500).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona a Expo Sports para levantamento do dorsal?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do dorsal-chip e da t-shirt oficial Kiprun decorre exclusivamente no Centro Kursaal Elkargunea (Av. de la Zurriola 1) na sexta-feira, 20 de novembro (das 16:00 \u00e0s 20:00), e no s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro (das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00). N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo da prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem pacemakers (marcadores de ritmo) e guarda-roupa na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. A Maratona disp\u00f5e de 35 pacemakers distribu\u00eddos por 8 objetivos de tempo final: 2h45, 3h00, 3h15, 3h30, 3h45, 4h00, 4h30 e 5h00. O servi\u00e7o de guarda-roupa funciona no Pal\u00e1cio de Congressos Kursaal durante a Expo Sports e no domingo da prova entre as 07:00 e as 08:15 (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 07:45 para os atletas dos 10K).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70210,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,31],"event_type_2":[809,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57903","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-san-sebastian-espanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-espanha","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-maratona-de-san-sebastian.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57903","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=57903"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57903\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70853,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57903\/revisions\